[136.485,"o","\u001b[2m# What the stack published: URL, credentials and the stack's access, as Secret Manager secrets under the prefix the stack outputs (KUBECONFIG\r\n# appears once OpenVidu is up: until then this read fails, and the command that continues the deploy waits for it).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
