[275.599,"o","── PLAN · nothing below has run ───────────────────────────────────────\r\nThis is what will be deleted from your Google Cloud project ***:\r\n\r\n  # Everything the Terraform state in .openvidu/gcp holds: the master, the media nodes'\r\n  # instance group, its instance template and autoscaler, the scale-in function and its\r\n  # Cloud Scheduler job, their disks, the static address, the firewall rules, the service\r\n  # accounts, the bucket's HMAC key, the secrets, the bucket with the recordings and Meet\r\n  # data.\r\n  terraform -chdir=.openvidu/gcp init -input=false -no-color -force-copy\r\n  terraform -chdir=.openvidu/gcp destroy -auto-approve -input=false -no-color\r\n\r\n  # Media nodes the scale-in function abandoned from their group are not in the state;\r\n  # they are listed and deleted too.\r\n  gcloud compute instances list --project=*** '--filter=name~^openvidu-e2e-gcp-el-s113145-media-node' '--format=value(name,zone.basename())'\r\n\r\n--delete-data: the recordings and Meet data are in the Cloud Storage bucket: this deletes them.\r\n── end of plan ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
